<%# The Danger Zone's Delete: the date change's own delete modal (Cancel or
   move this date, Tim 2026-11-27), rendered outside the edit form since it
   carries its own form. Cancel, move, and bring back are pages of their own. %>
<%= render "manage/date_changes/delete_modals", show: @show, production: @production,
      series: ShowChangePlan::Dates.series(@show), following: ShowChangePlan::Dates.following(@show),
      blockers: ShowChangePlan::Delete.blockers([ @show ]), open: false %>
